/config.txt
!/config-test.txt
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

# Model artefacts and their label files live in ~/aicam-models on claw-mini,
# outside this working tree -- see CLAUDE.md. These patterns are belt and
# braces for anything that still lands here.
#
# On 2026-09-13 a `git stash -u` used to get a deploy past a dirty working
# tree swept every untracked file in the checkout, and the `git stash drop`
# after it discarded them: all five ONNX models, both label files, the plate
# and exclusion data, and twelve config backups. Nothing failed until the
# next restart, three commits later, because the running process already had
# the model in memory. Recovering it needed `git fsck --unreachable`, and a
# `git gc` in between would have made that impossible.
*.onnx
/ipcams-labels.txt
/vehicle-labels.txt
/license-plates.json
/excludes.json
/excludes.json.bak-*
/config.txt.bak-*
